---
import ProjectLayout from "../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
import { labProjects, projectClips, clipSourceBase } from "../data/lab-projects";
import { labFigures } from "../data/lab-figures";
import { asset } from "../data/paths";
import "../styles/accessibility.css";
const project = labProjects[0];
const figures = Object.values(labFigures);
---
<ProjectLayout title={`Accessibility — ${project.title}`} shortTitle={project.shortTitle} description={`Accessibility and media credits for ${project.title}.`} slug={project.slug} source="" nav={[]} bare>
  <div class="a11y-page">
    <h1>Accessibility &amp; media credits</h1>
    <p>This research page is designed with WCAG 2.1 Level A and AA requirements in mind. Accessibility is an ongoing effort; automated checks do not constitute a complete compliance certification.</p>
    <p><a href={asset("")}>Back to {project.title}</a></p>
    <section aria-labelledby="using-heading">
      <h2 id="using-heading">Using this page</h2>
      <p>A skip link leads to the main content. Focused controls have a visible outline, and the layout adapts to narrow screens and increased text spacing. Informative images have alternative text and longer descriptions, listed below.</p>
      <p>Videos use native controls. They can start muted when visible and pause outside the viewport or in a hidden tab; manual pause is remembered. Reduced-motion and data-saving preferences disable automatic playback, and native controls remain available without JavaScript. Each video has a text description and a timed WebVTT description track; videos with narration also have English captions.</p>
      <p>Release checks include axe scans targeting WCAG 2.1 A and AA, keyboard navigation, 320 CSS-pixel reflow, increased text spacing, image descriptions, and heading structure. Screen-reader usability has not been fully evaluated, and linked publisher pages are outside these checks.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="media-credits" aria-labelledby="media-heading">
      <h2 id="media-heading">Image and video descriptions</h2>
      {figures.map(figure => <article><h3>{figure.title}</h3><p>{figure.description}</p><p class="a11y-source">Source: {figure.source}</p></article>)}
      {projectClips.map(clip => <article><h3>{clip.title}</h3><p>{clip.description} {clip.audioNote}</p>{clip.processingNote && <p class="a11y-source">{clip.processingNote}</p>}<p class="a11y-source">Source: {clip.sourceUrl ? <a href={clip.sourceUrl}>{clip.sourceLabel}</a> : clip.sourceFile ? <a href={`${clipSourceBase}/${clip.sourceFile}`}>DreamXLab original recording</a> : clip.sourceLabel}; {clip.sourceRange}.</p></article>)}
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="notes-heading">
      <h2 id="notes-heading">Source notes</h2>
      <ul>{project.sourceNotes.map(note => <li>{note}</li>)}</ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</ProjectLayout>
